<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12541" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόδρᾱσις</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδόχ-δρησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδιδράσκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running away, escape,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.140
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					27.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔστιν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>CG</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>escape from, avoidance of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.166
				</span></i>
			; <i>evasion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐρωτήσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.641c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
